Well...{VAR BE01}
If anything should happen to our king,
it would be disastrous.{VAR BE01}
It would ruin Ghetsis's perfect plan!{VAR BE01}
Our lord N will be disappointed, but
the six of us shall defeat you here!{VAR BE01}

Lenora: So sorry...{VAR BE01}
Not only are we stronger than you,
but there are a lot of us!{VAR BE01}

Elesa: Ignoring Team Plasma...{VAR BE01}
That would be a terrible thing
for us Gym Leaders to do.{VAR BE01}

Giallo: Ghetsis called us the chosen ones.{VAR BE01}
He chose us and gathered us here
so we can change the world!{VAR BE00}
For us, defeat is impossible!

Ryoku: We can only do our best and
leave the rest to fate.{VAR BE01}
We've done everything in our power.
All we can do now is believe in our{VAR BE00}
lord N...and wait.

Gorm: A single fallen leaf signals the
start of autumn.{VAR BE01}
We know our history.{VAR BE01}
The emergence of this castle is
the harbinger of change in Unova...

Clay: Things aren't gonna go th' way ya
fellas think they are!{VAR BE01}
I'm sure o' that!

Drayden: I can empathize with some of
what you say, but I can't forgive the{VAR BE00}
way you reject everything else!
